MiqwFBVV95cUxOQkJfWG9LRkdWX21PZVozMVhKVkhoaFVmTld2Z3pGT3JpV0d1NWtIYUhqU2Q4cHRVQzFLa0tPUnVQS0RjQ193Skx2ZkxuUmdVMGVlVk1Xb2lPbnNlZTB3NWpjY1prcHR4a1lDVkdNQUVGY2RlOEx5Zy1OZ2x3TkRneVh1WktOQlFFZEs3N2ZSc1llVl8wb3AtLUVLV0l2NGM3dVdmbUtIM2l5WUU?oc=5","date":"2026-10-30","zh":"Align Technology 財報電話會議凸顯全球成長"},{"title":"Align Technology Q3 Earnings Call Highlights","src":"TradingView","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxORWNlVlFJMFZSV1c0a3hHNFNQNzR6YlI3MG9YdXVNUDNUMFNNbmlVdTNtb2FOTHlKa3JkQXRxSmJCaWR0N2psWW9obFJESG1GZ0l1Y1FlWFA1YkhqWUlWMk5jTnVkVjVIbHFLbnhzV2k5YVJNR2x0QkJzRHBzTE1hZm9UUmladWRWQUliNjZWZ2xDaXNWTS1CalRiSkRZd1pkRTFKeE9jWk0?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"Align Technology 第三季財報電話會議亮點"},{"title":"ALGN Q3 Earnings & Revenues Beat, '26 Sales View Down, Stock Falls","src":"Yahoo Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxOS2dkN053ZlVUZTVoTEttZTBaRm9YTTAtZ3A3VmpmVmFmcTI4d1dWVmk2TmFiQWk5U1ZOOU91cW9jc0VEX19sSjlmaDRzTmVLbTRIZGpGTWM4RHJRaTduMVVjQ1FCRHZCU3J5WkJGelQwSFIzazl6YnI4ZVVyMG5uRVhtVkRGRTRYNE1qYU5zV2pQWVUtRlRURC1ZSQ?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"ALGN 第三季獲利和收入超出預期，'26 銷售前景下滑，股票下跌"},{"title":"AAO Establishes Sleep-Disordered Breathing Task Force to Update Clinical Guidance","src":"Orthodontic Products","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"AAO 成立睡眠呼吸障礙工作小組以更新臨床指導"},{"title":"Align Technology price target lowered to $210 from $215 at Leerink","src":"TipRanks","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxOaG1weWtNMDBnQ1UwWk5paFNvVEpJN2tEWDh6YTNqRi1MempmZU14UThLaEFQcVp3dWI5QkNPcXlKU0ZpZUpiUkRUdWhuR2VxRlhIY0w4dF8zNjVCdkFyRjBsaXNxcE82aEpPMUlzNjlJZWxqSk8wcmpfS3hGck43VHB6bHNVYl93THVHVGR4eERZRFF0U1p2dEp3NEtrYTAyU21pck9QbEtlalMweVhpTnA3Ums?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"Leerink 將 Align Technology 目標價從 215 美元下調至 210 美元"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":12},{"name":"分析師評等","count":3},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-27","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1097149/000109714926000014/algn-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Align Technology, Inc. (\"we,\" \"us,\" \"our,\" \"Align\" or the \"Company\") is a global medical device company primarily engaged in the design, manufacture and marketing of Invisalign clear aligners for the treatment of malocclusions, or the misalignment of teeth, by orthodontists and general dental practitioners (\"GPs\"), ViveraTM retainers for retention, iTeroTM intraoral scanners and services for dentistry, and exocadTM computer-aided design and computer-aided manufacturing (\"CAD/CAM\") software for dental laboratories and dental practitioners. Our vision and strategy is to revolutionize orthodontic and restorative dentistry through digital treatment planning and implementation using the AlignTM Digital Platform, an integrated suite of proprietary technologies and services designed to deliver a seamless, end-to-end solution for patients, consumers, orthodontists, GPs and lab partners. We striv","zh":"Align Technology, Inc.（下稱“我們”、“我們的”、“Align”或“公司”）是一家全球性醫療器械公司，主要從事設計、製造和營銷 Invisalign 隱形矯正器（供正牙醫生和普通牙科醫師（“GP”）治療咬合不正或牙齒不齊）、用於固位的 ViveraTM 保持器、iTeroTMTM 內exocadTM適用於牙科實驗室和牙科醫師的電腦輔助設計和電腦輔助製造（“CAD/CAM”）軟體。我們的願景和策略是透過使用 AlignTM 數位平台進行數位化治療規劃和實施，徹底改變矯正和修復牙科。 AlignTM 數位平台是一套專有技術和服務的整合套件，旨在為患者、消費者、矯正醫師、全科醫生和實驗室合作夥伴提供無縫的端到端解決方案。我們努力"},{"en":"globally, our iTero intraoral scanners as the preferred scanning technology for digital dental scans and our exocad CAD/CAM software as the dental restorative solution of choice for dental labs.","zh":"在全球範圍內，我們的 iTero 口內掃描儀作為數位牙科掃描的首選掃描技術，而我們的 exocad CAD/CAM 軟體作為牙科實驗室的首選牙科修復解決方案。"},{"en":"Our corporate headquarters are located at 410 North Scottsdale Road, Suite 1300, Tempe, Arizona 85288. Our telephone number is 602-742-2000. Our internet address is www.aligntech.com. Our Americas regional headquarters is located in Raleigh, North Carolina, U.S.A.; our European, Middle East and Africa (\"EMEA\") regional headquarters is located in Rotkreuz, Switzerland; and our Asia Pacific (\"APAC\") regional headquarters is located in Singapore.","zh":"我們的公司總部位於 410 North Scottsdale Road, Suite 1300, Tempe, Arizona 85288。我們的電話號碼是 602-742-2000。我們的網路網址是 www.aligntech.com。我們的美洲地區總部位於美國北卡羅來納州羅利；我們的歐洲、中東和非洲（「EMEA」）地區總部位於瑞士 Rotkreuz；我們的亞太地區（「APAC」）區域總部位於新加坡。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"Our sales and marketing efforts are focused on increasing adoption and utilization of the Invisalign System and Vivera retainers by orthodontists and GPs and integrating the iTero scanner and services and exocad CAD/CAM products into dental labs and practices. The iTero scanner is an important component to the customer experience and is central to a digital approach as well as overall customer utilization of Invisalign clear aligners. In each region, we have direct sales, marketing and support organizations, which include quota carrying sales representatives, sales management and sales administration. We also have distribution partners in certain markets. Our sales and marketing personnel are organized primarily to support orthodontists and GPs, allowing highly trained and specialized personnel to serve each customer channel, thereby increasing our focus and","zh":"我們的銷售和行銷工作重點是提高正牙醫師和全科醫生對 Invisalign 隱適美系統和 Vivera 維持器的採用和使用率，並將 iTero 掃描儀和服務以及 exocad CAD/CAM 產品整合到牙科實驗室和診所中。 iTero 掃描器是客戶體驗的重要組成部分，對於數位化方法以及 Invisalign 隱適美隱形矯正器的整體客戶使用率至關重要。在每個地區，我們都設有直接銷售、行銷和支援組織，其中包括配額銷售代表、銷售管理和銷售管理。我們在某些​​市場也有分銷合作夥伴。我們的銷售和行銷人員主要為正畸醫生和全科醫生提供支持，讓訓練有素的專業人員為每個客戶管道提供服務，從而提高我們的關注度和"},{"en":"effectiveness on both. We continue to expand in existing markets through targeted investments in sales resources, professional marketing and education programs. Additionally, our consumer marketing programs are designed to create awareness and educate consumers on the benefits of Invisalign treatment and Vivera retainers, including where they can find trained doctors to provide treatment.","zh":"對兩者都有效。我們透過對銷售資源、專業行銷和教育計劃的有針對性的投資，繼續擴大現有市場。此外，我們的消費者行銷計劃旨在提高消費者意識並教育消費者了解 Invisalign 隱適美療程和 Vivera 維持器的好處，包括他們可以在哪裡找到訓練有素的醫生來提供治療。"}],"competition":[{"en":"Our clear aligner products compete directly against traditional orthodontic treatments that use wires and brackets and increasingly against clear aligner products manufactured and distributed by various companies, both within and outside the United States. Although the number of competitors varies by segment, product, geography and customer, they include new and well-established regional competitors in certain foreign markets, as well as larger companies, divisions of larger companies or well-capitalized new entrants with substantial sales, marketing, research and financial capabilities at cost-effective rates. We also compete with direct-to-consumer (\"DTC\") companies that provide clear aligners directly to consumers requiring little or no in-office care from doctors and also from doctors who manufacture retainers and custom clear aligners using 3D printing technology.","zh":"我們的透明矯正器產品直接與使用鋼絲和托架的傳統矯正治療方法競爭，並且越來越多地與美國國內外各公司製造和分銷的透明矯正器產品競爭。儘管競爭對手的數量因細分市場、產品、地理位置和客戶而異，但它們包括某些國外市場中新的和成熟的區域競爭對手，以及較大的公司、較大公司的部門或資本充足的新進入者，這些新進入者俱有強大的銷售、營銷、研究和財務能力，且具有成本效益。我們也與直接面向消費者（「DTC」）的公司競爭，這些公司直接向消費者提供透明矯正器，很少或不需要醫生的辦公室護理，也需要使用 3D 列印技術製造保持器和定制透明矯正器的醫生。"},{"en":"Additionally, we face competition in the rapidly evolving markets for intraoral scanners and software solutions, including CAD/CAM. The global intraoral scanner market is very dynamic with participants spanning from traditional dental conglomerates to companies dedicated primarily to scanner development and sales with new entrants playing larger roles. The iTero intraoral scanner also competes with traditional PVS impressions that doctors use for clear aligner therapy or other dental procedures, as well as other intraoral scanners. It also competes with traditional bite wing 2D dental x-rays for detecting interproximal caries. Information regarding risks associated with increased competition may be found in Part I, Item 1A of this Annual Report on Form 10-K under the heading \"Risk Factors.\"","zh":"此外，我們還面臨快速發展的口腔內掃描器和軟體解決方案（包括 CAD/CAM）市場的競爭。全球口內掃描儀市場非常活躍，參與者從傳統的牙科集團到主要致力於掃描儀開發和銷售的公司，新進業者發揮更大的作用。 iTero 口內掃描儀也與醫療用於透明矯正器治療或其他牙科手術的傳統 PVS 印模以及其他口內掃描儀競爭。它還可以與傳統的咬翼二維牙科 X 光在檢測鄰間齲齒方面進行競爭。有關與競爭加劇相關的風險的資訊可在本年度報告 10-K 表第一部分第 1A 項「風險因素」標題下找到。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Clear Aligner","val":3245404000,"zh":"透明對準器"},{"name":"Systems & Services","val":789560000,"zh":"系統與服務"}],"total":4035000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":1661185000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Other International","val":1453191000,"zh":"其他國際"},{"name":"CH","val":920588000,"zh":"CH"}],"total":4035000000}},"peers":["IDXX","DXCM","EW","ILMN","PAYC"]}}